==English==
[[File:Efeito dominó.gif|thumb|320px|upright|The domino effect.]]
[[File:Domino effect.jpg|thumb|200px|upright|Domino effect.]]

===Etymology===
by analogy with a row of dominoes in which the fall of one leads to a cascade of falling pieces

===Noun===
{{en-noun|?|sg=[[domino]] [[effect]]}}

# the effect of one [[event]] setting off a [[chain]] of similar events
# {{politics}} the [[theory]] that, if [[Vietnam]] fell to [[communism]], it would be followed by [[Cambodia]] and [[Laos]] etc

